Used by: fettle, to read PDF documents as text.

Why it is here: the assistant's own file reader is denied outright, which
makes fettle the only reader on the machine. A developer holding a PDF of
the requirements would otherwise simply be unable to open it. PdfPig was
chosen because it is pure managed C# with no native assets - fettle
publishes self-contained and single-file per operating system - and has
no transitive dependencies at all.
